      {
        "user": "How many archers can I train with 100k food?",
        "assistant": "With 100k food and archers consuming 2 food each, you can train 50,000 archers (100,000 ÷ 2 = 50,000)."
      },
      {
        "user": "What counters cavalry?",
        "assistant": "Pikemen and Halberdiers are effective counters against cavalry due to their anti-mounted bonus. Position them in front of your ranged units."
      },
      {
        "user": "Decode this packet",
        "assistant": "I'll decode the AMF3 packet for you. Please provide the hex data and I'll parse the action command and parameters."
